SDUSD::maxMint
├── given PAUSE_TYPE is paused
│   └── it should return zero for every receiver
└── given PAUSE_TYPE is not paused
    ├── when depositCapUsage is below depositCap
    │   ├── it should convert the remaining DUSD headroom to shares with downward rounding
    │   ├── it should not vary by receiver
    │   └── reward vesting may change the share-denominated maximum without consuming DUSD headroom
    └── when depositCapUsage is equal to or above depositCap
        └── it should return zero without underflowing
